{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/ezgif-7-a66d192ada.gif?t=1743501790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alchemy of the Earth is set in an open world dreamscape where herbalism and alchemy are your only tools of survival. Gather ingredients, brew potions and poultices, find loot to survive the harsh nights and uncover the secrets of the island\u2019s creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/ezgif-7-218d09e827.gif?t=1743501790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Check out my youtube channel to the right of this description -------------------------&gt;  <br>for more <strong> Alchemy of the Earth</strong> stuff!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/ezgif-7-4031186bda.gif?t=1743501790\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find your way through the Veil:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a large hand-crafted world with distinct environments and sweeping vistas. Traverse ruined settlements and overgrown wilderness, picking up pieces of history of the island as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/ezgif-7-5c38956a46.gif?t=1743501790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pick every flower:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alchemy of the Earth is the ultimate flower picking simulator. Navigate through dense forests and wide meadows with millions of harvestable ingredients, but don\u2019t pick them all by hand, progress your character and discover unique ways to gather resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/ezgif-7-7e0efd7312.gif?t=1743501790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grind ingredients, brew potions, distill magic:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With hundreds of distinct ingredients, items, poultices, and potions to discover the power of the elements is in your hands. Use your knowledge of aspects and essences to craft dozens of unique potions and spells.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/ezgif-7-a55ffb6c0b.gif?t=1743501790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Struggle to survive the creator\u2019s failed experiments, sling potion bombs, cast spells, mix and match different combat effects to gain an edge on your enemy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/y568586.gif?t=1743501790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full Narration and soundtrack:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the story of Alchemy of the Earth through over 50 audio narrations and 40 minutes of original music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2788430?t=1743501790","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743501790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743501790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743501790","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","