e ultimate flower picking simulator. Navigate through dense forests and wide meadows with millions of harvestable ingredients, but don\u2019t pick them all by hand, progress your character and discover unique ways to gather resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/ezgif-7-7e0efd7312.gif?t=1743501790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grind ingredients, brew potions, distill magic:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With hundreds of distinct ingredients, items, poultices, and potions to discover the power of the elements is in your hands. Use your knowledge of aspects and essences to craft dozens of unique potions and spells.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/ezgif-7-a55ffb6c0b.gif?t=1743501790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Struggle to survive the creator\u2019s failed experiments, sling potion bombs, cast spells, mix and match different combat effects to gain an edge on your enemy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/y568586.gif?t=1743501790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full Narration and soundtrack:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the story of Alchemy of the Earth through over 50 audio narrations and 40 minutes of original music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Tamalpais Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai